    "After every sync Openband sends that sync's data to these addresses as JSON. Requests are signed; check them with the secret on the receiving side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Openband her senkrondan sonra o senkronda okunan veriyi bu adreslere JSON olarak gönderir. İstekler imzalıdır; alıcı tarafta gizli anahtarla doğrulayabilirsin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After every sync your data also goes to %@. Open your panel in a browser; your API key is in Band › Openband settings › Web access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verilerin her senkrondan sonra %@ adresine de gider. Panelini tarayıcıda açabilirsin; API anahtarın Bant › Openband ayarları › Web erişimi'nde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After pairing, Huawei Health loses the band. Nothing is deleted from the band, and you can pair it with Huawei Health again any time.": {
      "comment": "A bullet point in the \"How it works\" section of the welcome view, explaining that pairing the band with Huawei Health doesn't delete any data from the band. It also means that you can pair the band",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eşleştirmeden sonra Huawei Health bandı kaybeder. Banttan hiçbir şey silinmez ve istediğin zaman Huawei Health ile yeniden eşleştirebilirsin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Age": {
